<c.simplifiedchinese>那天起</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:04.658 --> 00:13:09.038 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队被剿灭 我就日夜不停的打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:09.121 --> 00:13:13.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有打架的时候 我才能忘记一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:13.834 --> 00:13:17.213 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
