204
00:14:15.271 --> 00:14:16.647 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:18.440 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没结束呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:18.524 --> 00:14:21.485 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没有倒下 我没有输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:21.569 --> 00:14:24.405 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以相乐和赤报队的名义发誓</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
