<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…难道你要…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:33.581 --> 00:14:35.833 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就对了 来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:35.916 --> 00:14:38.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
