212
00:14:38.377 --> 00:14:39.295 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:39.879 --> 00:14:41.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:45.926 --> 00:14:48.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是不是找错打架的对手了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:49.138 --> 00:14:53.767 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队教导你的是去杀维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:56.228 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
