220
00:15:08.282 --> 00:15:10.784 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么资格说这种话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:10.868 --> 00:15:12.036 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你错了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:12.786 --> 00:15:15.915 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心不是这种人</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:16.665 --> 00:15:19.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他从不关心荣耀或权力</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:19.418 --> 00:15:22.129 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是用剑自由地保护大家的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:22.922 --> 00:15:26.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你只知道他是刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:26.133 --> 00:15:29.595 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>少自说自话 突然过来找茬了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:29.678 --> 00:15:30.596 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:30.679 --> 00:15:33.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你还想接着打
就让我来当你的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:35.059 --> 00:15:38.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左 维新还没有结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:39.021 --> 00:15:40.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:40.606 --> 00:15:45.986 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>表面上十年前维新就已经结束了
现在是明治时代了</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:46.695 --> 00:15:49.782 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但那些真正需要幸福的人们</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:50.282 --> 00:15:53.953 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>仍然深陷在一个
弱者任人鱼肉的旧体制中</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:55.663 --> 00:15:56.914 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:56.997 --> 00:16:03.462 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是为了给这样的人提供一些帮助
才继续挥舞这把刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:04.755 --> 00:16:07.549 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许需要一年 也许需要十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:16:07.633 --> 00:16:11.220 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也可能维新永远不会结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:16:11.971 --> 00:16:12.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:16:13.347 --> 00:16:19.269 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这是向那些在明治维新中
牺牲的人补偿的方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:16:20.729 --> 00:16:23.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>向那些在下作为刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:24.441 --> 00:16:28.362 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀害的人们赎罪的方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:38.706 --> 00:16:40.457 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和他一样…</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:44.378 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>梦想着真正的新时代并为之努力</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:44.461 --> 00:16:49.508 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他和相乐队长一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:50.968 --> 00:16:55.055 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他至今都在为之战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:55.889 --> 00:16:59.476 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我却陷入绝望 放弃了理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:00.102 --> 00:17:03.439 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>每天用打架麻痹自己 企图忘记一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:10.738 --> 00:17:13.407 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 相乐队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:14.491 --> 00:17:16.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是这个男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:17.953 --> 00:17:20.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我完全输给他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:28.797 --> 00:17:31.842 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说斩左的伤势很重</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:31.925 --> 00:17:34.303 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>全身是伤 大量出血</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:34.386 --> 00:17:38.307 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要保住一命 得住三个月院才行</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:38.807 --> 00:17:45.105 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左跟以前的敌人完全不在一个级别
在下也不好手下留情</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:45.189 --> 00:17:46.982 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:49.818 --> 00:17:51.320 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:55.908 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说 别再这么沮丧了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:55.991 --> 00:17:58.160 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊…在下并没有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:58.243 --> 00:17:59.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:02.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左昨天说的话或许有几分道理</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:02.915 --> 00:18:05.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你并不是那种维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:09.129 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>通过昨天的战斗 斩左也一定了解了</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:10.047 --> 00:18:12.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙虽然挺傻的 但肯定明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:13.008 --> 00:18:15.010 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以别再担心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:15.552 --> 00:18:17.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你安慰在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:18.514 --> 00:18:19.348 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅）</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:19.431 --> 00:18:23.602 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们转换下心情
痛快地吃一顿牛锅吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:23.685 --> 00:18:24.561 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又吃？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:26.313 --> 00:18:27.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:29.233 --> 00:18:32.111 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>咦？你们是前几天的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:32.194 --> 00:18:33.445 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:33.946 --> 00:18:36.949 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不介意被人挑衅</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:37.032 --> 00:18:40.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但至少先练练再来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:41.245 --> 00:18:42.454 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:43.163 --> 00:18:45.791 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哟 昨天谢谢你照顾我啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:46.291 --> 00:18:47.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:47.459 --> 00:18:49.670 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经能自由活动了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:50.629 --> 00:18:53.215 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的优点就是耐打</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:53.298 --> 00:18:55.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这点伤不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:57.719 --> 00:18:58.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-戳
-戳</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:58.929 --> 00:19:00.013 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>戳</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:04.560 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的优点就是耐打</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:04.643 --> 00:19:06.770 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这点伤不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:06.854 --> 00:19:09.606 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 他在逞强</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:10.941 --> 00:19:11.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:11.859 --> 00:19:15.237 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不准备摘掉背上的“恶”字吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:20.534 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队是我不能忘记的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:21.034 --> 00:19:22.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没法摘下这个字</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:23.328 --> 00:19:28.500 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我都19岁了
现在想改变我恶劣的性格也太晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:29.001 --> 00:19:33.630 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也在想
你昨天的话嘴上说说倒是容易</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:19:34.923 --> 00:19:35.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:19:35.924 --> 00:19:40.179 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你跟那些满口空话的维新志士
到底哪里不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:44.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后我会一直缠在你身边亲眼见证的</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:45.684 --> 00:19:47.603 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:47.686 --> 00:19:49.813 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我已经不再是斩左了</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:49.897 --> 00:19:52.566 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀断了 我也不再做打手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:56.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我是相乐左之助
一个热爱打架的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:57.237 --> 00:20:01.033 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你不再是刽子手拔刀斋一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:03.076 --> 00:20:09.041 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以 没有我的允许
可别偷偷去流浪啊 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:10.042 --> 00:20:11.084 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:12.044 --> 00:20:14.254 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>又一个奇怪的伙伴加入了队伍</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:14.338 --> 00:20:15.214 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:15.297 --> 00:20:17.090 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅）</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:17.174 --> 00:20:18.175 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>妙小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:18.842 --> 00:20:21.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助先生他又没付钱…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.347 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:22:05.782 --> 00:22:07.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>求…求你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:22:07.701 --> 00:22:09.661 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要多少钱我都给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:22:09.745 --> 00:22:12.247 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以 求求你饶我一命…</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:22:13.415 --> 00:22:18.462 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们维新志士都让钱给迷昏头了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:22:23.717 --> 00:22:25.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什…这是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:22:25.469 --> 00:22:27.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我全身都动不了了</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:22:27.345 --> 00:22:28.680 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:22:34.102 --> 00:22:36.688 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:22:44.946 --> 00:22:47.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《黑笠》</c.simplifiedchinese>

